facts=[
('D01','DayCare.initialize creates2 slots and resets egg_generated=false/step_counter0, then captures DAY_CARE_POKEMON_GAIN_EXP_FROM_WALKING and DAY_CARE_POKEMON_CAN_SHARE_EGG_MOVES settings into mutable attributes. Later setting changes alone do not replace captured attributes.',['DayCare329–335']),
('D02','DayCare.deposit increments stats.day_care_deposits before fetching Pokemon or checking capacity. Empty index or no free slot raises after increment. Free slot.deposit first assigns original same Pokemon reference, heals, optionally SHAYMIN form=0 then captures level; only after normal slot completion wrapper deletes original party index and resets egg counters. No last-able/egg/cannot_store guard in this wrapper. Earlier failure may leave both slot and party referencing same object.',['DayCare273–278','DayCare437–450']),
('D03','withdraw validates filled slot then party not full; increments day_care_levels_gained by actual level_gain, pushes same slot Pokemon then slot.reset and counter reset. It does not invoke heal. A later exception preserves earlier counter/append prefix. No payment deduction here; slot.cost returns(level_gain+1)*100 separately.',['DayCare287–297','DayCare452–464']),
('D04','update_on_step_taken increments step_counter; >=256 resets0, if no current egg and2 members checks compatibility chance[0,20,50,70] or Oval[0,40,80,88] and rand100. Sharing then has separate mutable share flag and rand100<50. gain_exp flag independently iterates slots every step, including steps without egg check.',['DayCare386–407']),
('D05','Slot.add_exp returns if empty or current exp>=maximum. It stores old_level then pokemon.exp += amount without its own clamp. If new level differs, calc and learn every move whose level equals final newlevel. Ordinary source+1 walking givesbounded increment; arbitrary public amount may crossmultiple levels without learning skippedlevels. Shadow exp= redirects delta to saved_exp and leaves current exp/cache, so ordinary level change consequence not universal.',['DayCare308–318','PokemonShadow13–20']),
('D06','EggGenerator basic Pokemon.new(species,EGG_LEVEL) completes constructor/form recheck before assigning Egg name/positivehatchsteps/obtaintext/happiness120. SINISTEA forcesform0 and getFormOnEggCreation optionalform= then parent inheritance can form= again after eggflag, so Pokedex register is possible for eggs and samevalueform. No generic no-seen guarantee from egg wrapper.',['DayCare1–89','Pokemon1128–1227']),
('D07','EggGenerator inheritance uses raw parent IVs, nature from Everstone holder, mother/nonDitto ability rules, deduplicated latest moves including configured father machine/mother egg paths. It uses owner.language difference for extra shiny retries (>=8:6, earlier5) and Charm2, resets shiny=nil before PID rerolls. Pokemon.foreign? is not Masuda gate. Pokerus separate chance; final calc does not change raw IV used for inheritance.',['DayCare89–258']),
('D08','share_egg_move requires exactly2 members and samebase species, free move space, legal eggmove not already known. Ifboth learners possible randomly choose one; uses first eligible knownmove for selected learner then learn_move, no first_moves addition. compatibility rejects Shadow/Undiscovered; intersectEggGroup or Ditto and compatiblegender then score1+sameSpecies+differentOwnerID.',['DayCare360–384','DayCare501–551']),
('D09','collect_egg first day_care.generate_egg (returnsnil unless2 members), then raisesifnil, then checks player.party_full?. Thus constructor/form/cache/globaldex writes can occur before full-party rejection. Normal pushes generatedegg and resets counters. It has no own egg_generated flag guard and does not increment eggs_hatched.',['DayCare354–358','DayCare488–496']),
('E01','Evolution animation cancel increments evolutions_cancelled, normal success increments evolution_count before cry/media/message and before species commit. Success invokes action_after_evolution first, then records wasfainted, species=, explicit hp0 ifwasfainted, calc, readyfalse, then dex register/owned. Later resource/handler failure preserves reached count/model/dex prefix. Learnedmove cancellation after commit does not undo evolution.',['EvolutionUI112–136','EvolutionUI195–244']),
('E02','Evolution.newspecies Dex prompt gate SHOW_NEW_SPECIES_POKEDEX_ENTRY_MORE_OFTEN && !was_owned && player.has_pokedex && unlocked membership; no see_form flag. Inside message then register_last_seen then EntryUI. It gathers moves at0 or finallevel then learns after the prompt; entry failure can prevent later learn while species/dex alreadywritten.',['EvolutionUI222–244']),
('E03','pbDuplicatePokemon clones Pokemon, then species=, name=nil, markings=[],ballPOKEBALL,itemnil,clearAllRibbons,calc,heal,pushparty,dexregister,setowned in that order. Plainclone already makesribbons new array, so clearAllRibbons does not clearoriginal ribbons; sharedmail is not explicitly cleared byduplicate and later getter may invalidate only clone reference. Shedinja after_evolution_proc checks partyfull thenbagPOKEBALL, callsduplicate, removesball thentrue; noensure rollback for later failure.',['EvolutionUI5–21','Evolution265–277','Pokemon1135–1150']),
('C01','Shadow clone invokes plainclone then, ifsaved_ev exists, writes samevalues through ret.saved_ev with no newhash allocation; it remains shared. shadow_moves list iscloned. Setting clone.saved_ev=nil duringpurify only detachesclone; directitem mutation beforedetach writes both. Default Shadow doesnot overrideheal_status; hp= callsbasehp= then clearsrawhyperifhp<=0.',['PokemonShadow13–26','PokemonShadow212–220']),
('DBG01','Debug forget_move receives index then checks>=0 before dereference/delete; cancellation-1 leaves list unchanged, unlike direct Pokemon.forget_move_at_index(-1). Debug setPP/ppup wrappers clamp chosenrange, ppup reduction conditionally reducescurrentpp. These are UIguards, not lowerMove setters.',['Debug473–568']),
('DBG02','Debug Owner either replacesOwner fromplayer or mutates currentOwner name/gender/id fields in place. ForeignID numeric selected0..65535 is val|(val<<16), not newcachedshiny calculation. cancelnegative menu breaks; noimplicitclearall caches or save. SharedOwner effects depend prior clone/alias construction, not this editor.',['Debug932–975']),
('DBG03','Debug species/form reads ordinaryform for messages, specieschange sets species thencalc and optional !settingUpBattle&&!egg dexregister. Formchoice can set forced_form beforeform= afteroverrideconfirm; removeoverride only nil thenrefresh. Underlying form= globalregister may stillrun independently of caller extra dexguard.',['Debug739–815']),
('DBG04','Debug hidden-values writesrawEV/IV thencalc/refresh. IndividualEV upper=min(EV_LIMIT-otherEV,EV_STAT_LIMIT), choosesdefaultmin(current,upper); randomizer zerosall thenallocates boundedincrements. pID randomize writesnew32bit thencalc without clearingcachednature/gender/shiny/ability. Debug discardable toggles eachcannot_store/release/trade separately.',['Debug209–319','Debug980–1003']),
('DBG05','Debug status rejectsegg thenHP<=0; cureheal_status, otherstatus setscount afterstatus write (SLEEP positivechosen only; other0). Debug duplicate confirmfalse no clone; normalclone storedparty/box byactualscreentype thenhardrefresh; delete confirm then directpartydelete orsceneRelease+heldnil/storageDelete, noTrainer.remove otherable safeguard.',['Debug31–83','Debug1095–1151'])]
